    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 BUG-09c: spring-petclinic reports 1 io-boundary, and it is a false positive (`List.size()` — see U16/BUG-10). Real coverage needs `java.io.*`, `java.nio.file.Files`, `java.net.URL/HttpURLConnection`, `java.net.http.HttpClient`, `java.sql.*` (db), JDBC, `Runtime.exec`, `ProcessBuilder`, SLF4J/Logback (logging). Must be type-aware to avoid the BUG-10 misclassification class."  # d55c
